# depot chart

Deploys the DEPOT backend: user-service, product-service, order-service and the api-gateway.

## Install / upgrade
helm upgrade --install depot ./chart -n default -f chart/values-minikube.yaml

## Environments
| File | Where |
|---|---|
| values-minikube.yaml | laptop (Minikube) |

## Rules for changing the chart
- Bump `version` in Chart.yaml on every change to the chart.
- Every new value is documented in values.yaml and the schema.
- Run `helm lint chart` and `helm template` before opening a pull request.

Built with Java 21, Spring Boot 4.1, Kubernetes 1.37 (Minikube) and nginx.